    <p class="section-label">
      ACCOUNT
    </p>

    <h1>
      Delete your Series Organizer+ account
    </h1>

    <p>
      Series Organizer+ is developed by Last Day Software.
      You can request deletion of your Series Organizer+
      cloud account even if you no longer have the application
      installed.
    </p>


    <section>

      <h2>What account deletion removes</h2>

      <p>
        Deleting your Series Organizer+ cloud account removes:
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>Your Series Organizer+ authentication account</li>
        <li>Your associated Series Organizer+ cloud backups</li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        Cloud backup snapshots are automatically removed when
        the associated Supabase authentication account is deleted.
      </p>

    </section>


    <section>

      <h2>What account deletion does not remove</h2>

      <p>
        Account deletion does not delete your Google Account.
      </p>

      <p>
        Local Series Organizer+ Library and tracking information
        may remain on devices where it was previously stored.
      </p>

      <p>
        Local data can remain until it is cleared from the device,
        removed through application functionality when available,
        or removed when the application's local storage is cleared
        or the app is uninstalled.
      </p>

    </section>


    <section>

      <h2>Request deletion</h2>

      <p>
        A public support contact will appear here once the
        Last Day Software support address has been confirmed.
      </p>

      <!-- Replace after confirmation:

      <p>
