      </p>

      -->

    </section>


    <section>

      <h2>Information needed to identify your account</h2>

      <p>
        The deletion request may require enough information
        to safely identify the Series Organizer+ account that
        should be removed.
      </p>

      <p>
        The exact verification information will be documented
        here once the deletion-support workflow is finalized.
      </p>

      <div class="policy-warning">

        <strong>
          Never send your password or authentication tokens.
        </strong>

        <p>
          Last Day Software will never require your Google
          password, Supabase access token, refresh token,
          authentication token or private credential in an
          account-deletion request.
        </p>

      </div>

    </section>


    <section>

      <h2>Processing time</h2>

      <p>
        The expected account-deletion handling time will be
        published here once the support workflow has been
        finalized.
      </p>

    </section>


    <section>

      <h2>Retention exceptions</h2>

      <p>
        If Last Day Software is legally required to retain
        specific information after an account-deletion request,
        that information may be retained only as required by
        applicable law.
      </p>

      <p>
        No additional retention period is currently stated on
        this page.
      </p>

    </section>


    <section>

      <h2>Using Series Organizer+ without an account</h2>

      <p>
        Series Organizer+ is local-first and does not require
        an account for normal local Library use.
      </p>

      <p>
        Deleting the cloud account therefore does not prevent
        the application from being used locally.
      </p>

    </section>


    <section class="policy-needed">

      <h2>Information needed from the developer</h2>

      <ul>
        <li>Public support email address or secure request form</li>
        <li>Account verification procedure</li>
        <li>Expected deletion handling time</li>
        <li>Any legally required retention exceptions</li>
      </ul>

    </section>

  </div>

</main>
